# TMC STUDENTMART — AI WORKSPACE RULES

## CORE DIRECTIVES
1. EXISTING PROJECT FIRST: Work exclusively inside the existing project. Never create a second project, new project folders, or duplicate components (e.g., no *V2.jsx, *New.dart, or redundant CSS).
2. STACK SEPARATION: Keep Laravel backend (backend/), React Admin portal (frontend/), and Flutter student app (student_app/) strictly separated.
3. SECURITY & AUTH: Never break Laravel Sanctum authentication, authorization roles (student, staff, admin), or API behavior.
4. INSPECT BEFORE MODIFYING: Always locate and modify existing files. Make the smallest safe change that solves the problem.

